// Solution to exercise 3.2 - the shape of 3.1, with the parts that vary left open.
//
// Sketching the accuracy argument next to the severe-error one shows they are the same
// six lines: a measurement, a bar, and a strategy confronting one with the other. What
// differs is *which* metric and *which* bar - so those two become @support hooks, and
// everything that does not vary stays in the template.

template quality_gate {

    conclusion holds    is "The quality bar is met"
    strategy   confront is "Confront the measurement with the bar"

    @support measured is "The metric has been measured"
    @support bar      is "The bar is agreed"

    confront supports holds
    measured supports confront
    bar      supports confront

}
